O.S. Systems Embedded Linux distribution OpenEmbedded/Yocto layer
=================================================================

This layer provides the base for the O.S. Systems Embedded Linux.  It
provides the "oel" distribution and a set of helpers used for multiple
products being developed with OpenEmbedded and/or Yocto Project.

This layer depends on:

URI: git://git.openembedded.org/openembedded-core
branch: master
revision: HEAD

Contributing
------------

To contribute to this layer you should submit the pull requests
on GitHub at https://github.com/OSSystemsEmbeddedLinux/meta-ossystems-base

Please refer to:
https://docs.yoctoproject.org/contributor-guide/

for some useful guidelines to be followed when submitting patches.

Source code:

    https://github.com/OSSystemsEmbeddedLinux/meta-ossystems-base

